  "body": "This is an excellent opportunity to secure a generously proportioned apartment offering space, comfort and effortless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nSet across an impressive 128m², this beautifully spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment also features a versatile study/office alcove - ideal for working from home, a quiet reading space or an additional area to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the ground floor, the apartment enjoys easy access to Hibiscus Drive, with a lovely covered 20m² deck providing a natural extension of the living space. Whether enjoying your morning coffee, entertaining friends or simply relaxing outdoors, this is apartment living at its best.\r\n\r\nInside, the thoughtful layout places the bedrooms and bathrooms at opposite ends of the apartment, creating a wonderful sense of privacy and separation for residents and guests alike. The generous kitchen is another standout, with an abundance of storage and excellent bench space, making it as practical as it is inviting.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include a separate laundry room, handy airing cupboard, two secure basement car parks and a lock-up storage area - perfect for bikes, golf clubs and all those extra outdoor essentials.\r\n\r\nWith its generous proportions, excellent storage and convenient ground-floor position, this apartment offers a wonderful combination of space and easy living.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have moved and this apartment is ready for its next owners. We warmly invite you to come along to an open home and experience everything it has to offer or contact us to arrange a private viewing. Visit Paul in the sales suite Tues-Sun 10am - 2pm.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty, Licensed REAA 2008.",
